    "body": "Based on test results in Firefox I calculated the first override here and it appears that this is already the existing behavior of gb18030 as written in the standard. As such this table isn't needed. It's not clear to me why the Unicode recommendation calls out these four-byte sequences mapping to code points if that matches existing behavior.",
