    "body": "WebKit (and presumably Chromium) having updated the table (as evidenced by https://github.com/vitorroriz/WebKit/commit/b7d4f07a3aac04e70f1d91d09be57e4dd2ded612) means GBK is impacted at the moment as well. In particular for the symmetrical mappings at the top of https://github.com/whatwg/encoding/issues/312#issuecomment-2354764499. What do we want to do for GBK? Perhaps it's okay if that gets slightly less PUA as well? @hsivonen what do you think?",
